  "description": "Wheel pickers made easy and cross platforms for both Maui and Xamarin Native, on Android and iOS.\n            \n            It's fully written in C# (it's not a binding) !\n            It's using native controls on iOS and a native view on Android ! It's not a SkiSharp drawing.\n\n            Supports:\n            - maui (.net9+)\n            - Android/iOS native (.net9+)",
